"These instructions explain how to build ArduPilot on board the Erle-Brain 2."
msgstr "这些说明介绍了如何在 Erle-Brain 2 开发板上构建 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:12
#: b5fc2d0ef4ae4068b2ecdafc429e3a34
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can follow `Erle-Robotics's instructions "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/>`__ on how to build from source on your PC."
msgstr ""
"或者您可以按照 `Erle-Robotics 的说明 <http://erlerobotics.com/docs/>`__ 在 PC 上从源代码构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:16
